1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000
Nothing pre-existing — this repository and everything in it was built during the hackathon.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Gravity here isn't global. Every fold of space has its own down, and its own clock.

3
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Break a fold and its contents drop into your world — late, and somewhere else.

4
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:24,000
The words, hints and signs were generated with Meta models at build time; the receipts are in the repo.

5
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Three rooms, one law. Gravit.
